      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Of the many Sunshine Coast (Qld) suppliers/installers contacted, the Sunworks Solar Pty Ltd (t/a The Sun Works Solar Centres) sales rep was the most professional, knowledgeable, and interested in the products, not in just making a sale and upselling or offering useless expensive add-ons. And the only one to actually go onto the roof to measure, rather than standing in the veggie patch gazing upwards. Result: REC panels over an SMA inverter pumping 20+ kWh/day.The installation team were experts. Each member knew what he was supposed to do and just got on with it.Paperwork clear and on time. Explanations and answers to neophyte questions concise and accurate.Wouldn't it be nice if all the businesses we had to deal with operated like this?",
